window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>“I told myself I would never return to this godforsaken city, to a family who couldn’t care less about me, but here I am.”</b></p> <p>Sloan tried to escape her family and their business as the nefarious mafia witches of Evrose Bay, and after five years of thinking she got away, one text changed everything—her twin brother found trouble. To make matters worse, it's with the most bloodthirsty vampires in the city. The Malbec coven will stop at nothing until a debt is paid.</p> <p>Sloan quickly finds herself in a situation from her twin's bad deeds. She was ready to pay the price, but when she realizes who is now in charge, her fears become something more. It's not money they want—it’s <i>her</i>.</p> <p>But it seems more is at work in the cruel city, where loyalty knows no difference in blood. Betrayals, blood magic, and plans for a new rule set chaos to the streets, and Sloan is tossed into the thick of it.</p> <p>On the brink of war, she has to decide:<b> run, fight, or die…</b></p>"; 
